        "skew": 0
      },
      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Turns content into a series of up to 10 cartoon-style image cards for Xiaohongshu and other social feeds.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "You want a post for Xiaohongshu (Little Red Book), WeChat image posts or another feed as a swipeable series of image cards"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Analyzes the content, recommends a structure, style and layout, then generates a cover, content cards and a closing card"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "Up to 10 PNG cards in one folder, with the analysis, the outline and every prompt"
            },
            {
              "label": "Looks",
              "text": "12 styles, such as cute (the default), notion, chalkboard or study notes, and 8 layouts, from sparse to dense, lists, flows and mind maps"
            },
            {
              "label": "Stays consistent",
              "text": "By generating the cover first and passing it as a reference to every other card"
            },
            {
              "label": "Needs",
              "text": "An image generator: your agent's own (as in Codex or Cursor), baoyu-image-gen with an API key, or a logged-in codex CLI"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Three outline strategies give structurally different posts: story-driven (hook, problem, discovery, experience, conclusion), information-dense (conclusion first, then facts, pros and cons, a recommendation) and visual-first (hero image, details, a lifestyle scene, a call to action). After the analysis, the agent shows its recommended plan and offers three paths: accept it, adjust the strategy, style, layout, palette and count, or a detailed mode that drafts all three outlines for you to choose from or combine. --yes skips every question and runs unattended. Twenty-six presets pair a style and layout for common scenarios, and three palettes (macaron, warm, neon) recolor any style. Cards render in batches of four by default, a watermark such as your handle can be added, and sensitive public figures are drawn as stylized cartoons. Wrong text on a card means a new prompt and a regeneration, never a patch.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/jimliu/baoyu-skills/tree/ca703c2d7c2c4399a1dc0cf82224f8551e05a96d/skills/baoyu-xhs-images"
