          "code-review",
          "design",
          "accessibility"
        ],
        "note": "Hands its findings to better-interface, which loads the six better-* skills, for severity, the cap and the verdict; without better-interface it reports only the scope and file list.",
        "model": "Claude Opus 5.5",
