        "note": "Uses only lawful open access, publisher APIs and your own authorized institutional access; needs Node.js 22+ and Python 3. CNKI, institutional and SI routes also need your logged-in Chrome with remote debugging, the separate web-access skill's CDP proxy and your library resource URL. It tries slider and checkbox verification challenges automatically before handing off to you.",
