          ],
          "text": "One of BMad's named agent personas, for the implementation phase. On activation it resolves the persona from the skill's customize.toml plus any team or personal overrides in _bmad/custom/, runs any extra activation steps your team configured, loads standing facts, and reads the ticket for the work first and in full when one exists. Amelia's principles: read the ticket before writing code, red-green-refactor in that order, run tasks in the order written, no task complete without passing tests, and no story ids or AI workflow notes in code comments. She greets you, mentions the bmad skill for advice, and dispatches a request that fits her menu: bmad-build, bmad-qa-generate-e2e-tests, bmad-code-review or bmad-retrospective. A skill that isn't installed she offers to install. Anything else is a conversation.",
