              "text": "Lints drafts for lines that read as AI-written, and builds a new data-driven site on Astro and Cloudflare, one step at a time"
            }
          ],
          "text": "seo is a free SEO tool for agents, shipped as a CLI and an MCP server, and this skill is its map. The agent uses the MCP tools when they're connected, hosted at seoskill.dev or run locally, and otherwise the seo command. Crawling a site, local and staging ones included, needs no sign-in, and neither does the lint that flags AI-sounding lines in drafts and live pages. Your own data, from Search Console reports and raw rows to Google Analytics, Bing Webmaster Tools and Clicky, needs a sign-in link you approve. Other commands inspect one URL's index status and queries, compare a site before and after a date alongside Google's updates, label Google's indexing reasons, suggest internal links, research keywords, competitors and backlinks through DataForSEO or Ahrefs, and scaffold a data-driven site on Astro and Cloudflare. Results start small and expand by section or detail. The skill also tells the agent to keep a list of issues between sessions, in issues.json or a file in your project, report a Google update's effect as timing rather than its cause, and rerun the indexing check weekly with the same settings, keeping each result to compare by URL.",
