      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Generates natively editable PowerPoint decks from your material, and builds templates, fills existing PPTX files or redesigns finished decks.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "You want a real, editable .pptx from a topic or documents, or want to beautify, template, refill or add narration and animation to a deck"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Runs a bundled Python check, then routes the request to one workflow: generate (default, quick, from images, or beautify), create a template, or edit a native PPTX"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "An editable .pptx whose pages can use Office's 187 preset shapes, connectors, gradients, native shadows and layered images"
            },
            {
              "label": "Asks first",
              "text": "At every blocking gate, where it waits for your confirmation instead of deciding for you"
            },
            {
              "label": "Needs",
              "text": "Python 3, to run the scripts that ship with the skill"
            },
            {
              "label": "Unlike html-ppt",
              "text": "That one builds static HTML slide pages; this one outputs PowerPoint files you keep editing in PowerPoint"
            }
          ],
          "text": "PPT Master turns a topic or your source material into a PowerPoint deck built from native, editable objects. Its SKILL.md is an entry point: it first runs a bundled Python integrity check and stops if that fails, then reads its routing file and picks exactly one route. Generating a deck has four profiles: the default, a quick one, image to PPTX, which recreates pages from pictures, and beautify, which redesigns an existing deck. The other routes create a reusable brand, style, layout or deck template, or edit a native PPTX in place. Every route is one cycle: plan until every input exists as a file or recorded decision, then author the pages, run the route's checks, repair at whichever layer owns a fault, and export. At each blocking gate it stops for your confirmation. Pages can use emphasis runs, pull quotes and hero numbers, Office's 187 preset shapes and connectors, full-bleed or shaped images, gradients, shadows and glow, and one motif varied across pages. It works in your language, while its design spec keeps English headings.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/hugohe3/ppt-master/tree/769547394107870a0c7b5ad8d1c0c75035123aef/skills/ppt-master"
