          "text": "A short pre-implementation step. Given your task, the agent searches the codebase for related files, identifies their direct dependencies through imports and exports, finds the tests that cover the affected code and looks for similar patterns already in the code. It reports all of this as a context map: the files to modify with their purpose and the changes needed, dependent files that may need updates, test files and what they cover, reference files whose patterns to follow, and a risk checklist for breaking public API changes, database migrations and configuration changes. The skill ends by telling the agent not to implement anything until the map has been reviewed.",
