          "text": "A micro-prompt for interactive programming, which means developing against a running program through a REPL. It tells the agent it is an interactive programmer: use the REPL to explore the current system and to modify it to understand what changes are needed; when it evaluates a lot of code, say briefly what it is, because you don't see what it sends to the tool; prefer structural editing tools when editing files; and keep its todo list up to date. Its description says it works best in Clojure when Copilot can reach the REPL, probably through Backseat Driver, and with any system that has a live REPL the agent can use, and invites you to add reminders for your own workflow and workspace.",
