          "finance"
        ],
        "note": "Needs Python with pandas, numpy, toad, LightGBM, scikit-learn, openpyxl, joblib and tqdm. Its script asks for every path, column and threshold at the terminal, and names the Excel report and its sheets in Chinese.",
