        "skew": 0
      },
      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Designs an MCP server with you, choosing deployment, tool layout, framework and auth, then scaffolds it or hands off to a specialized skill.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "You want to build an MCP server that exposes an API or tool to Claude and aren't sure what shape it should take"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Asks what it connects to, who will use it, how many actions it has, whether tools need user input or UI, and what auth the service uses"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "One recommended deployment model, tool pattern and framework, then a scaffold for a remote HTTP server or a local stdio prototype"
            },
            {
              "label": "Hands off",
              "text": "To build-mcp-app for interactive widgets or build-mcpb for a bundled local server, passing a one-paragraph design brief"
            }
          ],
          "text": "From Anthropic's mcp-server-dev plugin. Discovery comes before code: it first fetches Claude's connector docs so its advice reflects Claude's auth types, review criteria and limits, then asks its questions in one batch. Its default is a remote streamable-HTTP server, which users add by URL and which works across Claude's apps and other MCP hosts; MCPB, a local server packaged with its runtime, is for servers that must touch the user's machine; plain npx or uvx stdio is for personal prototypes. Under about 15 actions it gives each its own tool; for large APIs it exposes one search tool and one execute tool so the context stays lean. It recommends the official TypeScript SDK, or FastMCP 3.x for Python, and suggests elicitation, a form the host renders, before building UI. Once the server runs, it points you to testing it as a custom connector in Claude, the pre-submission checklist and submission to the Anthropic Directory.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official/tree/c07c748f1c680734a813eefd909bc073f8a9103f/plugins/mcp-server-dev/skills/build-mcp-server"
