      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Works with you on an article or post from outline to final draft: researching with citations, sharpening the hook and reviewing each section.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "You're writing a blog post, article, newsletter, case study or tutorial and want a partner through it"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Outlines with you, researches claims and adds citations, offers alternative hooks, and reviews each section as you finish it"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "An outline with a research to-do list, cited findings, per-section feedback with line edits, and a full-draft review"
            },
            {
              "label": "Keeps",
              "text": "Your voice: it suggests options instead of rewriting, and asks whether it still sounds like you"
            }
          ],
          "text": "The agent starts by asking about the topic and argument, audience, length, goal, sources and your style, then builds an outline with a hook, introduction, sections marked where research is needed, a conclusion and a research to-do list. When you ask for research it finds sources, pulls out facts, quotes and data, and adds them with citations in the style you want: inline, numbered or footnotes, with a running reference list. For your opening it says what works and offers three rewrites, such as a bold statement, a story or a surprising number. After each section it reports what works and suggests fixes for clarity, flow, evidence and style, with before-and-after line edits. The final review covers structure, argument, evidence, citations and readability, and ends with a pre-publish checklist. It also sketches workflows for blog posts, newsletters, technical tutorials and thought-leadership pieces.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/ComposioHQ/awesome-claude-skills/tree/be2a406907dbc61b73e6827ded415c96139d13a2/content-research-writer"
