      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Lists what a README, API doc, runbook, architecture doc or onboarding guide should cover, with five principles for clear technical docs.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "You ask for a README, API reference, runbook, architecture doc or onboarding guide"
            },
            {
              "label": "It gives",
              "text": "A short checklist of the sections each of those five document types should have"
            },
            {
              "label": "Principles",
              "text": "Write for the reader, put the most useful information first, show code examples, commands and screenshots, keep docs current, link instead of copying"
            },
            {
              "label": "Unlike doc-coauthoring",
              "text": "That one drafts a doc with you section by section and tests it on a fresh reader; this one is a one-page checklist with no templates or steps"
            },
            {
              "label": "Part of",
              "text": "The engineering plugin of Anthropic's knowledge-work plugins"
            }
          ],
          "text": "A short reference the agent picks up when you ask it to document something. For each document type it lists what to cover. A README says what the project is and why it exists, gets you to a first success in under five minutes, then covers configuration, usage and contributing. API docs give endpoints with request and response examples, authentication, error codes, rate limits, pagination and SDK examples. A runbook says when to use it, what access you need, the steps, how to roll back and who to escalate to. An architecture doc covers context and goals, a high-level design with diagrams, key decisions and trade-offs, and data flow. An onboarding guide covers environment setup, how the key systems connect, common tasks and who to ask. Five principles apply to all of them.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/anthropics/knowledge-work-plugins/tree/ab4cb1cd383b4eb87383be8cf4e70cb5b2a2348d/engineering/skills/documentation"
