        "description": "Writes a lean, one-to-two-page PRD in eight sections, asking first about the problem, users and success metric if you haven't said.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "You're writing a PRD or feature spec, or want an existing PRD reviewed"
