            },
            {
              "label": "Part of",
              "text": "backnotprop/bro, a set of small alignment skills such as readback, recap and status"
            }
          ],
          "text": "The whole skill is one instruction: restate your last message, stop using jargon, speak coherently, and say it more simply and concisely, like one human talking to another. It acts on a single reply. Unlike output-style modes that stay on for the session, you call it each time a reply loses you, and the agent goes back to its usual voice afterwards. Its frontmatter turns off automatic invocation, so the agent never applies it on its own.",
