            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Maps /seo commands such as audit, page, schema or local to the matching sub-skill, and runs /seo audit as parallel specialist subagents"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "One report with an SEO Health Score from 0 to 100 and an action plan sorted Critical, High, Medium, Low"
