          "text": "Context7 indexes documentation for software libraries and serves it by topic. This skill calls Context7's public HTTP API directly with curl. The first request searches by library name and a topic, such as react and hooks, and returns matches with an ID, title, description and snippet count. The second fetches documentation for that ID and a specific query, as readable plain text when type=txt is set. It includes worked examples for React hooks, Next.js routing and FastAPI dependency injection, and tips: be specific in the query, check further search results when the first is wrong, and URL-encode spaces.",
