            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "A numbered spec in docs/specs/ with requirements, decision, build plan and consequences, and a separate rationale file for big decisions"
            },
            {
              "label": "Reads",
              "text": "The scope and AGENTS.md files the workflow's other skills write, when they exist"
            },
            {
