              "text": "Researches audience and competitors, locks positioning and a campaign angle, then writes each layer of copy in order"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "A positioning brief, landing page copy, an email sequence, LinkedIn and X posts, video scripts, ad variants, a day-by-day calendar and a copy review"
