        "updated": "2026-11-06",
        "skew": 0
      },
      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Cuts LLM API spend with model routing by task size, budget tracking, retries only on transient errors, and prompt caching.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "You're building an app or batch job that calls Claude, OpenAI or similar APIs and its spend needs a ceiling"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Routes small tasks to a cheap model and large ones to a stronger one, tracks spend against a budget, retries only transient errors, and caches long prompts"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "Python patterns that compose into one pipeline function, with Anthropic SDK examples"
            },
            {
              "label": "Also has",
              "text": "A 2026 per-token price table for Claude models"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Four cost controls for code that calls LLM APIs, shown in Python with the Anthropic SDK. Model routing picks Haiku by default and Sonnet once the text or item count passes a threshold, with a way to force a model. Cost tracking uses frozen dataclasses: each call returns a new tracker with the call's tokens and cost added, and the pipeline stops with an error once the budget is exceeded rather than overspending. Retries cover only connection, rate-limit and server errors, with exponential backoff, and fail at once on authentication or bad requests. Prompt caching marks the long system prompt with cache_control so it isn't resent on every request, saving cost and latency; it recommends this for prompts over 1,024 tokens. A composition example chains all four, and best practices add starting with the cheapest model, logging routing decisions to tune thresholds, and keeping model names in config rather than scattered through the code.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/affaan-m/ecc/tree/d2ef2680594f9a17526a6e1a2e18b3d242c5d17b/skills/cost-aware-llm-pipeline"
        },
