      },
      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Lists operating controls for long-running agent systems: lifecycle, observability, safety scopes and kill switches, rollout and rollback, and incident steps.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "Agents run continuously or in the cloud, beyond single CLI sessions, and need production controls"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Names four areas to cover (lifecycle, observability, safety, change management), the baseline controls and five metrics to track"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "A short checklist and a six-step response for when failures spike"
            },
            {
              "label": "Keep in mind",
              "text": "It's a one-page outline: it names PM2, systemd, containers and CI/CD gates but gives no commands or configs for them"
            }
          ],
          "text": "A brief checklist from ECC for agent systems that run continuously or in the cloud. It splits operations into runtime lifecycle (start, pause, stop, restart), observability (logs, metrics, traces), safety controls (scopes, permissions, kill switches) and change management (rollout, rollback, audit). The baseline controls are immutable deployment artifacts, least-privilege credentials, secrets injected per environment, hard timeouts and retry budgets, and an audit log for high-risk actions. The metrics to track are success rate, retries per task, time to recovery, cost per successful task and the spread of failure types. When failures spike, it says to freeze new rollouts, capture representative traces, isolate the failing route, patch with the smallest safe change, rerun regression and security checks, and resume gradually. It names PM2, systemd, container orchestrators and CI/CD gates as where it applies, without setup steps for any of them.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/affaan-m/ecc/tree/d2ef2680594f9a17526a6e1a2e18b3d242c5d17b/skills/enterprise-agent-ops"
