          ],
          "text": "A five-stage outreach pipeline. Signal scoring searches Exa and X for people in your target verticals, roles and locations, weighting role fit at 30%, industry 25%, recent activity 20%, followers 10%, location 10% and engagement with your content 5%. Mutual ranking pulls your X following and LinkedIn connections and scores each mutual with the same bridge formula as the repo's social-graph-ranker skill, sorting targets into warm-intro, conditional-intro and cold tiers. Warm path discovery traces intro chains through mutuals, investors, co-workers, alumni, events or content engagement. Enrichment pulls each lead's title, company, funding, recent news and last 30 days of posts, plus LinkedIn profiles through browser-use. Drafts match your voice, taken from your recent X posts or the brand-voice skill, and use one channel picked in order: warm intro by email, direct email, LinkedIn, then X. Its rules ban generic templates, multiple asks and fake familiarity. Four bundled agents, signal-scorer, mutual-mapper, enrichment-agent and outreach-drafter, split the work.",
