              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Pairs each vulnerability with vulnerable and hardened code, using OpenZeppelin's ReentrancyGuard, SafeERC20 and Ownable2Step, a Uniswap V3 TWAP read and FullMath"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "Code checked against an 11-item checklist, plus Slither static analysis and Echidna and Foundry fuzzing commands to run before production"
