        "description": "Prevents token amounts off by orders of magnitude across EVM chains: query decimals at runtime, cache by chain and address, and use exact math.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "You read ERC-20 balances or price tokens across EVM chains, or a balance or USD value is off by orders of magnitude"
