        "skew": 0
      },
      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Reviews a prediction-market, oracle or trading-agent workflow for advice, regulatory, data-quality, security and privacy risks before it touches keys or portfolio data.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "A prediction-market, basket, oracle or trading-agent workflow is about to handle venue logins, API keys, portfolio data or trade planning"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Checks five gates: advice boundary, venue and regulatory limits, data quality, security and privacy"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "Pass, warn or fail findings, the actions it blocks, required mitigations and a safe next step"
            },
            {
              "label": "Blocks",
              "text": "Buy, sell, hold or sizing recommendations, and any execution step without a separate implementation plan and your explicit approval"
            }
          ],
          "text": "A review gate from ECC, run before a prediction-market workflow touches anything financial or execution-capable. The advice gate keeps output informational, strips buy, sell, hold and sizing recommendations and keeps manual decision points explicit. The venue gate looks at terms, geography restrictions, account limits and API rules, flags betting, derivatives, securities or commodities ambiguity for legal review, and refuses to bypass restrictions or rate limits. The data gate checks liquidity, spreads, resolution rules, stale prices and timestamps, and labels public venue data apart from the gated data of Itô, an API it names by its ITO_API_KEY. The security gate forbids requesting or storing private keys, seed phrases or passwords, keeps the Itô and venue API keys out of logs and docs, defaults to read-only scopes, and requires circuit breakers, spend limits, dry runs and human approval before any execution is added. The privacy gate minimizes portfolio, financial and knowledge-base data and redacts private sources in public artifacts. It changes nothing itself: it reports.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/affaan-m/ecc/tree/d2ef2680594f9a17526a6e1a2e18b3d242c5d17b/skills/prediction-market-risk-review"
