        "description": "Guides building award-style landing pages and components: a committed visual direction, preloaders, scroll-driven motion, cursor interactions, fluid typography and performance rules.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "You ask for a premium landing page, an interactive portfolio or an \"Awwwards-style\" component"
