          "text": "A short PR-review loop from OpenAI's catalog of Codex skills. The agent confirms gh is authenticated, asking you to run gh auth login if not, and runs gh with elevated network access, retrying with escalated permissions if a sandbox blocks it. A bundled script, fetch_comments.py, prints all comments and review threads on the open PR for the current branch. The agent numbers each one with a short summary of what fixing it would take and asks which to address, then applies the fixes for those you pick. If gh hits an auth or rate-limit problem midway, it asks you to log in again and retries. The SKILL.md has no step for replying on GitHub, resolving threads or committing. The openai/skills repository is marked deprecated; its README points to openai/plugins for current Codex skills.",
