        "note": "Opinionated for Cloudflare, Vercel, PostHog and French law. One PostHog option is the author's own proxy, hogpost.samber.dev, and a few steps assume the author's own spreadsheets and sites. It asks before installing any of the skill packs it suggests.",
        "model": "Claude Opus 5.5",
