      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Designs and builds one animated isometric line figure in the Hairline style, which reacts to the pointer, as a single self-contained HTML file.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "You want a new Hairline figure, an isometric line drawing that reacts to the pointer, such as an empty-state illustration, from an idea or an SVG mark"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Offers two or three concepts, writes the figure on Hairline's fixed engine, then checks it with a validator and a sheet of eight screenshots until both pass"
