      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Searches over 200 icon libraries through Iconify with the better-icons CLI and fetches icons as SVG at the color and size you set.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "Your project needs an icon and you'd rather use a real one from Lucide, Material Design Icons, Heroicons, Tabler or another Iconify set"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Searches by keyword, optionally within one collection, and prints an icon's SVG by its prefix:name ID, such as lucide:home"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "SVG on stdout or in a file, or every search result downloaded into an icons folder, at the color and pixel size you set"
            },
            {
              "label": "Also",
              "text": "Documents the better-icons MCP server, whose tools also recommend icons for a use case and add them to a project's icons file"
            },
            {
              "label": "Needs",
              "text": "The better-icons CLI, installed globally with npm or Bun, or run through npx or bunx"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Better Icons searches more than 200 icon libraries through the public Iconify API. `better-icons search` takes a query with an optional collection prefix, a result limit and JSON output, and with -d downloads every match as SVG files, optionally recolored and resized. `better-icons get` prints one icon's SVG, optionally colored and sized, ready to redirect into a file. The skill also lists the MCP server's tools, set up with `better-icons setup` for agents such as Cursor and Claude Code: search across all libraries, get one icon or up to 20, list collections, recommend icons for a use case and style, find similar icons across collections, sync an icon into a project's icons file as a React, Vue, Svelte, Solid or SVG component, and scan a project for the icons it uses.",
