      "skillMd": {
        "version": "d7b5633f91591ee3bf55c8d80831b515498cc0e6",
        "updated": "2026-11-07",
        "skew": 0
      },
      "agentReview": {
        "description": "Quizzes you on a phase of the AI Engineering from Scratch course with eight questions from its lessons, naming lessons to re-read.",
        "tldr": {
          "glance": [
            {
              "label": "Use it when",
              "text": "You've finished a phase of AI Engineering from Scratch and want to know whether you're ready for the next"
            },
            {
              "label": "It does",
              "text": "Reads that phase's lesson docs, from your clone or GitHub, and writes eight multiple-choice questions: four on concepts, four on building"
            },
            {
              "label": "You get",
              "text": "One question at a time, a grade from Mastered to Start Over, and for each miss the right answer, why, and the lesson to re-read"
            },
            {
              "label": "Then",
              "text": "Offers a fresh quiz on the same phase, another phase, or an explanation of a missed topic"
            }
          ],
          "text": "It takes a phase number from 0 to 19 or a name such as transformers or rl, and lists all 20 phases when the input doesn't match. Questions come only from the lessons' own docs, not general knowledge; for a phase of 15 lessons or more it reads a spread from the start, middle and end. Each question names its lesson and has four plausible options, and the answer stays hidden until you reply. Seven or eight right is Mastered, which says you're ready for the next phase; five or six is Almost, three or four Developing and two or fewer Start Over, each listing what to go back over. Retakes avoid repeating questions until the pool runs out. If a phase has no lessons written yet, it says so. On the final phase, it checks LEARNING.md before congratulating you on finishing the whole course.",
          "permalink": "https://github.com/rohitg00/ai-engineering-from-scratch/tree/d7b5633f91591ee3bf55c8d80831b515498cc0e6/skills/check-understanding"
        },
