          "text": "The image counterpart of videoagent-video-studio, from the same repo. The agent matches the request to a model: midjourney for cinematic or painterly art, flux-pro for photorealistic portraits and products, flux-dev as the balanced default, flux-schnell for drafts in about 2 seconds, ideogram for images with text such as logos and posters, recraft for vector icons and flat design, sdxl for anime, and nano-banana for Gemini-powered images with a consistent style, which also takes reference images. It adds style, lighting and quality words suited to the model, then runs tools/generate.js with the model, prompt and aspect ratio, from 1:1 to 21:9, plus an optional image count, negative prompt and seed. Requests go through a hosted proxy, image-gen-proxy.vercel.app, which handles the model keys; IMAGE_STUDIO_PROXY_URL and IMAGE_STUDIO_TOKEN point it at your own. The script waits for the result, Midjourney included, and returns JSON with the image URLs, which the agent passes on. After a Midjourney grid it offers to upscale or vary one of the four images, or to reroll the prompt.",
